{"title":"TOPHATs Asian Comedy $$ and Waterworks Happy Hour","startsAt":"2026-10-09T17:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-09T21:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join Lawrence, your top hatted host, for an evening of Crafty goodness, Local food and Asian Comedy.\n\nAt 5:30pmish we will meet-up at the Waterwork Bar. I'll be there a little early to secure a table for our group, so look for my top hat.\n\nhttps://www.waterworksfoodhall.com/restaurants/waterworks-bar\n\nThere are lots of food options in the Waterwork Food Hall.\nMy eye is on Hanoi Bites Vietnamese sandwich, though Rasta Pasta may be my meal if I am more hungry.\n\nhttps://www.waterworksfoodhall.com/restaurants\n\nAt 7pmish we will walk over to The Rivoli, where we’re escaping Thanksgiving with an all-Asian comedy lineup featuring headliner Rahul Topiwala, birthday boy and host Anto Man-Ming Chan, Alia Rasul, Rush Kazi and Jordan Hanoun.\n\nBig laughs, great comedians, and absolutely no obligation to sit through your racist uncle’s dinner-table material.\n\nFollow the link below for your tickets on Eventbrite $22.90 or you can pay more at the Door.\n\n[asiancomedyallstars.eventbrite.com](https://asiancomedyallstars.eventbrite.com/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAcGRvZgVicmlkETEwNGpuU2h6OUtrNFZucnRQc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHvY-guwsm5bXVN7IJxWFHjc9CBZ4MARk97Xg8cCPf_X1q-u6czMfJceDrJ45_aem_9fpi8sYDZUWdwW_o4NpQLg)","venue":{"name":"Waterworks Food Hall","address":"50 Brant St, Toronto, ON M5V 3G9, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.647175,"lng":-79.399414,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Beer Lovers","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/e/d/c/highres_536356092.jpeg"}